Fixed five blocks erroring in the blocks gallery. `accordion` needs `data.data` with a nested `blocks_layout`, `slateTable` needs `data.table.rows`, and `highlight` reads `state.content.subrequests` keyed by block id — all three threw on undefined. `search` and `eventCalendar` dispatch thunks on mount, which the plain mock store rejects, so the gallery now uses Volto's real-store wrapper. All 42 registered blocks render without error. @ericof
